{"2711020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Long Trip", "steam_appid": 2711020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/7fc31b03dc8e6aea94064bcce67553f5.avif?t=1787616566\" width=1280 height=320 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/91fe30df603b148f92e4dae635c395fd.webp?t=1787616566\" width=616 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World of Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the death of its captain, you inherit The Dust, one of the last flying ships still capable of sailing between the shattered lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey beyond the horizon to discover lost kingdoms, forgotten strongholds, hidden treasures, and ancient mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every destination offers new dangers, new opportunities, and new stories waiting to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/0395224627cb41c2aeb9e64d6b013c56.webp?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/5717c06ffd118af817d414edf3fb20fe.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/5717c06ffd118af817d414edf3fb20fe.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/5717c06ffd118af817d414edf3fb20fe.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Epic Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face powerful enemies across the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle towering monsters, ancient dragons, corrupted champions, cursed spirits, and other legendary foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every major encounter presents unique mechanics, challenges, and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on preparation, skill, and the ability to adapt when the battle turns against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dragons &amp; Legendary Mounts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every challenge can be overcome on foot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride dragons through the skies, charge into battle on warhorses, and hunt dangerous prey alongside battle wolves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounts provide unique combat abilities, traversal options, and strategic advantages during exploration and major encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering each mount opens new ways to travel, fight, and survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/1e11469753b4af2e0ac1400f054a0907.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/1e11469753b4af2e0ac1400f054a0907.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/1e11469753b4af2e0ac1400f054a0907.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><i>Boss Design</i></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Allies of The Dust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dust is more than a ship—it is a refuge for travelers, warriors, scholars, merchants, and wanderers from across the shattered lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people you encounter throughout your journey may return to The Dust, share their stories, offer their services, or aid you when the road ahead becomes most dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some allies can even be called upon during major encounters, providing valuable support when victory seems out of reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive VR Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in fast-paced, skill-based combat built specifically for VR.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swords, spears, shields, and melee weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bows, firearms, and hand cannons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic abilities and tactical tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounted combat on land and in the skies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn enemy attack patterns, exploit weaknesses, stagger opponents, and strike when opportunities appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory rewards timing, awareness, preparation, and mastery of your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/2d6574103197b38df209cafd46383032.webp?t=1787616566\" width=616 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for Every Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure rewards those who prepare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful equipment, rare resources, magical abilities, hidden treasures, and ancient knowledge throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear, craft ammunition, gather supplies, and prepare for the challenges that await beyond the next horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make before battle often determine the outcome once the fighting begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore the shattered lands aboard your skyship, The Dust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ Face epic boss battles and legendary foes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 Ride dragons and legendary mounts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Skill-based VR combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Summon allies for major encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Discover powerful loot and magical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Adventure across ruins, islands, fortresses, and battlefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 Craft, prepare, and survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/91fe30df603b148f92e4dae635c395fd.webp?t=1787616566\" width=616 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/38be393e7997908288a97981007428b0.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A World of Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the death of its captain, you inherit The Dust, one of the last flying ships still capable of sailing between the shattered lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p clas