the skies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn enemy attack patterns, exploit weaknesses, stagger opponents, and strike when opportunities appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every victory rewards timing, awareness, preparation, and mastery of your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/2d6574103197b38df209cafd46383032.webp?t=1787616566\" width=616 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/a3fb595bed21cb5cba39bce9fe0d7d21.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for Every Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure rewards those who prepare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful equipment, rare resources, magical abilities, hidden treasures, and ancient knowledge throughout the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear, craft ammunition, gather supplies, and prepare for the challenges that await beyond the next horizon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make before battle often determine the outcome once the fighting begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.poster.avif?t=1787616566\" width=618 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.webm?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/extras/24d726007740704b1c654546a27bd441.mp4?t=1787616566\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Explore the shattered lands aboard your skyship, The Dust</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗡️ Face epic boss battles and legendary foes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 Ride dragons and legendary mounts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Skill-based VR combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Summon allies for major encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ Discover powerful loot and magical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 Adventure across ruins, islands, fortresses, and battlefields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔨 Craft, prepare, and survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Long Trip is a dark fantasy VR action RPG where you explore the shattered lands aboard the skyship The Dust, battle bosses, ride legendary mounts, summon allies, and uncover ancient secrets across a world scarred by war.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/090a18a4600e4e8e35cfb14aadd9675101d54467/header.jpg?t=1787616566", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711020/7531090669c94cea0377b5b5fa490703cbd743a9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787616566", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.ak